{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33001","headline":"寄嵩阳道人 · 曹邺","name":"寄嵩阳道人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三山浮海倚蓬瀛，路入真元险尽平。\n华表千年孤鹤语，人间一梦晚蝉鸣。\n将龙逐虎神初王，积火焚心气渐清。\n见说嵩阳有仙客，欲持金简问长生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}